Memory Spaces

I would formally introduce the following.

Working Memory

Current reasoning state.

Very small.

Highly dynamic.

Milliseconds.

Attention Space

Subset of Working Memory.

Contains only the currently relevant cognitive elements.

Think:

CPU registers.

Active Context

Everything immediately required for reasoning.

Think:

RAM.

