Memory Consolidation

Another improvement.

Humans don't permanently store everything.

They consolidate.

MOS should too.

Working Memory

↓

Evaluation

↓

Reflection

↓

Consolidation

↓

Semantic Memory

↓

Archive

This prevents:

duplicate facts,
redundant embeddings,
memory explosion,
contradictory knowledge.
Memory Decay

Not deletion.

Activation changes over time.

Every Cognitive Element could have:

activation score,
importance score,
recall frequency,
reinforcement score,
decay rate,
consolidation state.

Exactly like a biological memory system.
